native aa64: a cross-package multi-return whose component is a managed interface value (@errors.Error) is miscompiled — the returned @Iface comes back as non-nil garbage and the scalar component is corrupted (here strconv.ParseInt etc. return (T, @errors.Error)), leading to a crash. Importer mis-sizes the @Iface tuple component (native-aa64 analogue of the LLVM cb8c0f1a ABI fix, multi-return case). Same-pkg multi-return @Iface, cross-pkg single @Iface return, and cross-pkg (int,int) multi-return all pass. See claude-todo.md.
